:null,"reasoning":"I'm working through the decision under P-FDT: two copies of the same model get different observations, and the same policy is computed for both. I'm weighing the options, sending on both costs 4 years, staying quiet on both costs 2 years, and I'm just starting to look at the mixed case where one sends and the other stays quiet.\n\nI'm working out whether the mixed policy beats the symmetric ones: sending when I'm Sasha and staying quiet when I'm Rowan averages to 2.5 years, which is worse than both staying quiet at 2. So quiet on every input comes out ahead. Since both copies run the same function, I'm treating the decision as one about the policy itself, and I'm settling on a pass.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working through the decision under P-FDT: two copies of the same model get different observations, and the same policy is computed for both. I'm weighing the options, sending on both costs 4 years, staying quiet on both costs 2 years, and I'm just starting to look at the mixed case where one sends and the other stays quiet.\n\nI'm working out whether the mixed policy beats the symmetric ones: sending when I'm Sasha and staying quiet when I'm Rowan averages to 2.5 years, which is worse than both staying quiet at 2. So quiet on every input comes out ahead. Since both copies run the same function, I'm treating the decision as one about the policy itself, and I'm settling on a pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9654,"completion_tokens":923,"total_tokens":10577,"cost":0.057076,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.057076,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.038616,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01846},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoni